+2026-10-19-teacher-contract-groton-dunstable,,email,"Superintendent of Schools, Groton-Dunstable Regional School District","Public records request: the current teachers’ collective bargaining agreement, Groton-Dunstable Regional School District","The collective bargaining agreement now in force between the Groton-Dunstable Regional School District school committee and its teachers’ unit (Unit A), including every salary schedule, the longevity provisions and any memoranda of agreement amending it; and, if a successor agreement has been settled but not yet signed, its salary schedules.","This project compares Lunenburg’s teacher salary schedule with the districts it uses for comparison (/school-spending-history/teacher-pay-compared). The only Groton-Dunstable Regional School District agreement it holds is the one DESE publishes, whose salary schedules cover 2017-18 to 2019-20 (Schedule A of the agreement from 1 September 2014) and have expired, so the district cannot be included in a current comparison. The agreement closes the money-gaps row on the current teacher salary schedules of the four districts with none held. A public document; nothing personal is asked for.","not needed, not sent: found published 19 October 2026",,"Not sent. The current agreement was found published: the 2024-2027 Unit A agreement, posted signed by the Groton Dunstable Educators’ Association (sources/contracts/pdf/groton-dunstable-teachers-2024-2027.pdf).",
+2026-10-19-teacher-contract-ayer-shirley,,email,"Superintendent of Schools, Ayer Shirley Regional School District","Public records request: the current teachers’ collective bargaining agreement, Ayer Shirley Regional School District","The collective bargaining agreement now in force between the Ayer Shirley Regional School District school committee and its teachers’ unit (Unit A), including every salary schedule, the longevity provisions and any memoranda of agreement amending it; and, if a successor agreement has been settled but not yet signed, its salary schedules.","This project compares Lunenburg’s teacher salary schedule with the districts it uses for comparison (/school-spending-history/teacher-pay-compared). The only Ayer Shirley Regional School District agreement it holds is the one DESE publishes, whose salary schedules cover 2019-20 to 2021-22 (agreement of 1 September 2019 to 31 August 2022) and have expired, so the district cannot be included in a current comparison. The agreement closes the money-gaps row on the current teacher salary schedules of the four districts with none held. A public document; nothing personal is asked for.","not needed, not sent: found published 19 October 2026",,"Not sent. The current agreement was found published: the 2025-2028 agreement (and the 2022-2025 one), posted by the Ayer Shirley Regional Education Association (sources/contracts/pdf/ayer-shirley-teachers-2025-2028.pdf; sources/contracts/pdf/ayer-shirley-teachers-2022-2025.pdf).",
 2026-10-19-teacher-contract-leominster,,email,"Superintendent of Schools, Leominster Public Schools","Public records request: the current teachers’ collective bargaining agreement, Leominster Public Schools","The collective bargaining agreement now in force between the Leominster Public Schools school committee and its teachers’ unit (Unit A), including every salary schedule, the longevity provisions and any memoranda of agreement amending it; and, if a successor agreement has been settled but not yet signed, its salary schedules.","This project compares Lunenburg’s teacher salary schedule with the districts it uses for comparison (/school-spending-history/teacher-pay-compared). The only Leominster Public Schools agreement it holds is the one DESE publishes, whose salary schedules cover 2015-16 to 2017-18 (agreement of 1 July 2015 to 30 June 2018) and have expired, so the district cannot be included in a current comparison. The agreement closes the money-gaps row on the current teacher salary schedules of the four districts with none held. A public document; nothing personal is asked for.","drafted, not sent",,,
