+2026-10-19-teacher-contract-ashburnham-westminster,,email,"Superintendent of Schools, Ashburnham-Westminster Regional School District","Public records request: the current teachers’ collective bargaining agreement, Ashburnham-Westminster Regional School District","The collective bargaining agreement now in force between the Ashburnham-Westminster Regional School District school committee and its teachers’ unit (Unit A), including every salary schedule, the longevity provisions and any memoranda of agreement amending it; and, if a successor agreement has been settled but not yet signed, its salary schedules.","This project compares Lunenburg’s teacher salary schedule with the districts it uses for comparison (/school-spending-history/teacher-pay-compared). The only Ashburnham-Westminster Regional School District agreement it holds is the one DESE publishes, whose salary schedules cover 2016-17 to 2018-19 (agreement of 1 July 2016 to 30 June 2019) and have expired, so the district cannot be included in a current comparison. The agreement closes the money-gaps row on the current teacher salary schedules of the four districts with none held. A public document; nothing personal is asked for.","not needed, not sent: found published 19 October 2026",,"Not sent. The current agreement was found published: the 2025-2028 Ashburnham-Westminster Teachers’ Association agreement, posted on the district’s Current Union Contracts page (sources/contracts/pdf/ashburnham-westminster-teachers-2025-2028.pdf).",
+2026-10-19-teacher-contract-nashoba,,email,"Superintendent of Schools, Nashoba Regional School District","Public records request: the current teachers’ collective bargaining agreement, Nashoba Regional School District","The Unit A collective bargaining agreement between the Nashoba Regional School District Committee and the Nashoba Regional Education Association for 1 July 2023 to 30 June 2026, and the one for 1 July 2026 to 30 June 2029, each with every salary schedule, the longevity provisions and any memoranda of agreement amending it.","This project compares Lunenburg’s teacher salary schedule with the districts the Lunenburg Budget Task Force named as comparable (FY2026 Superintendent’s proposed budget, page 57; sources/data/comparison-sets.csv). Nashoba is one of them and the only one whose current agreement was not found. DESE holds the 2021-2022 agreement; the School Committee ratified a 2023-2026 Unit A agreement on 15 June 2023 (its minutes) and a 2026-2029 memorandum of agreement on 18 June 2026, and neither was found on the district’s site (its contracts page loads no documents without a browser), DESE’s educator contracts page or a union site. The agreement closes the money-gaps row on the current teacher salary schedules. A public document; nothing personal is asked for.","drafted, not sent",,,
